    "head_commit_message": "feat(native): what the wounded come to as one crate pass (spec 39 step 8b5-xxv)\n\nFormationRecovery.step is now one crate call, recovery_step\n(recovery/pass.rs): the listed squads' living and downed read in the\ncrate, recovery run, and its decisions landed there - deaths of wounds,\nthose playing dead, those coming to joining a formation (out of their own\nsquad, behind its rearmost, loose where they lie) or setting off alone -\nwith \"died_of_wounds\", \"playing_dead\" and \"came_to\" in the log. GDScript\nmirrors the states, the playing dead and the squads' lists; the strays\nstay its own. Records 8b5-xxv's split: the strays are 8b5-xxvi.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi3kfzTtHSJ7pJJsdsw",
